0003  $CM CONWAY'S GAME OF LIFE: A GLIDER ON A 6 BY 6 BOARD THAT WRAPS AROUND
      ⍝ CONWAY'S GAME OF LIFE: A GLIDER ON A 6 BY 6 BOARD THAT WRAPS AROUND
0004  $CM U IS EACH CELL WITH THE CELLS ABOVE AND BELOW; N ADDS THE SIDES
      ⍝ U IS EACH CELL WITH THE CELLS ABOVE AND BELOW; N ADDS THE SIDES
