[1]   U ← (¯1 ⊖ B)+B+1 ⊖ B
0007  N $AL ($NG1 $RV U)+U+1 $RV U
[2]   N ← (¯1 ⌽ U)+U+1 ⌽ U
0008  Z $AL (N=3)$OR B$AN N=4
[3]   Z ← (N=3)∨ B∧ N=4
0009  $DL
[4]   ∇
0010  $CM SHOW EACH GENERATION, THEN THE NEXT, K TIMES
      ⍝ SHOW EACH GENERATION, THEN THE NEXT, K TIMES
